  "plain": "Bob Maguire, a former contractor for the CIA, America's foreign intelligence agency, talks about the 2023 incident when a Chinese balloon floated over the United States. He says he knows for a fact that the US has a red phone, a direct emergency line, to China, because the Secretary of Defense and General Mark Milley, then the top US military officer, said they picked up the phone during the balloon disruption. He tells it to show that a crisis in the sky had direct emergency channels between the two powers working behind the scenes."
